    summary: "No one leads well alone. This lesson studies Exodus 18:13-27, Nehemiah 2:11-18 and 3:1-32, Numbers 11:10-17, Acts 6:1-7 and Ephesians 4:11-13 to see Moses exhausted until Jethro advised him to appoint capable men over thousands, hundreds, fifties and tens, Nehemiah casting vision and involving everyone in rebuilding the wall, God sharing Moses' burden with seventy elders, and the apostles delegating to the seven, with principles for vision, delegation, training and recognition.",
